"comments": {
"@02o7n1ikoroctudn36212fp40m": "The items of a cell's list, each drawn by row and all put inside (ul, div, …). An item still there when the list changes keeps its row as it was; only new items get one. Solid's <For> (prior art).",
"@0jmctamk2aq8n1um16no7445p9": "A footer element with these children: the page's foot.",
"@0l678q9apd9fj7t66km628hmkk": "The same element with this id.",
"@1i8km00actf1lq7k9s07gjfjd6": "An attribute whose value doesn't change.",
"@3rcetcdhkqp1cnqca1upsdi702": "The same element in this class, for a style sheet's rules to select.",
"@5jhntdn3g1m4thgdpt9sbtknpn": "A h2 element with these children: a second-level heading.",
"@7ndql018cde1rlri2iuj1mv6gl": "A label element with these children: a label for a field.",
"@8f8qvh4hi5jrggbq23a4ua70b5": "A li element with these children: one item of a list.",
"@99qc4rkl72d3fdv6n7pkjuar5j": "A section element with these children: a part of the page.",
"@9mesmjhhpqte8q98kp7d6o3g8b": "A style element holding these rules.",
"@b32nda336d8pt64dh0uflcjvv7": "Text that doesn't change. Text that does is text(() => …), which the page runs again when what it reads changes.",
"@bgokc2t4qrpi9t89lmee3ljbeo": "The same element with these attributes added after its own. Text and parts have no attributes, so they come back as they are.",
"@ethan0mp91h4eijugqieuv2639": "A h1 element with these children: the biggest heading.",
"@i5ubqsflp002ng7ftls5caj62b": "A span element with these children: a run of text inside a line.",
"@j3sn21jc87csod97epjaf9ftd4": "An element with these children, for a tag that has no function of its own here (main, nav, table, …). Each tag a function, as in Elm's Html module (prior art).",
"@j4fkc4vaqvg2evkoafcurqf4hm": "A button with this label that runs then when it's clicked.",
"@l1ibnd69fhv5j8j3reredg1ar1": "A style sheet rule: a selector and its declarations. A style sheet is a list of these, so it shows rule by rule instead of as one long text.",
"@mn6cn12jntgn0dd781i9m3nsud": "The same element with this inline style (CSS declarations, such as color: #777; margin: 0).",
"@qb6hbloqseba7sg033uledjji8": "An input field: it has attributes and no children.",
"@qkuhqcbmjs39emhmggtmshc2j6": "A p element with these children: a paragraph.",
"@r27hr8fo208632v63qsrnr34fc": "A div with these children. To give it attributes, wrap it: styled, classed, with.",
"@rrc61bud51hgr319omhcik166b": "The texts with between between each two of them.",
"@trf0pss3p7df3hpdsf10hskutu": "A strong element with these children: important text, usually bold.",
"@u0riog0n9hfrl76jjo3i5rd4iq": "A ul element with these children: a list with bullets, whose items are li.",
"@urmvgd3e2dcctt7q85g15nql15": "Rules that apply only when the query holds, such as (prefers-color-scheme: dark).",
"@v4m3u10hkehjb5097mejohqi5p": "A length in pixels, from a Float64 or an Int."
},
